BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://iondistrict.com/wp-
 content/uploads/2026/07/Tech-Transfer-Thursdays-Flyer-2.png?ver=1784747442
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://iondistrict.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07
 /Tech-Transfer-Thursdays-Flyer-2.png?ver=1784747442
UID:nIwM6-l75NP0tD0Bz1pXj
SUMMARY:Tech Transfer Thursdays
DTSTAMP:20260810T100231Z
DTSTART:20260820T173000Z
DESCRIPTION:Register here: https://mailchi.mp/rice/aug-20th-ion-event-landi
	ng-page \nUniversities and research institutions produce some of the most 
	valuable discoveries in the world\, yet navigating the path to commerciali
	ze them is not always clear or well known. Houston’s universities and rese
	arch institutions are partnering to to simplify the commercialization proc
	ess. \nMark your calendars for Thursday\, August 20th for the launch of Te
	ch Transfer Thursdays at The Ion District! \nI’m thrilled that the Rice Un
	iversity Office of Technology Transfer is teaming up with the tech transfe
	r offices at Baylor College of Medicine and Houston Methodist for our firs
	t event in this monthly series. Together\, we are partnering to spotlight 
	the breakthrough innovations and technologies developed across our respect
	ive institutions\, and show you exactly how to leverage this intellectual 
	property (IP) to launch new ventures or create strategic growth opportunit
	ies for your business. \nEach month will feature a different domain focus\
	, and we are kicking off August with Digital Health! \nWho Should Attend?\
	n💡 Founders & Operators: Looking for breakthrough technology to serve as t
	he foundation for your next venture or strengthen your IP moat. \n🏢 Corpor
	ate Innovators: Seeking external research to bridge technical gaps\, accel
	erate roadmaps\, or unlock new business models. \n📈 Investors & VCs: Searc
	hing for vetted\, high-barrier-to-entry university spinouts and deep-tech 
	startups. \nEvent Snapshot:\n5:30 PM: Open Networking & TTO Booths\n6:00 P
	M: TTO Panel on the licensing & commercialization roadmap\n6:40 PM: Univer
	sity Startup Pitch Spotlight\n7:00 PM: Free Networking\n\nhttps://iondistr
	ict.com/event/tech-transfer-thursdays/\n\nFrom Ion District
URL:https://iondistrict.com/event/tech-transfer-thursdays/
LOCATION:Ion\, 4201 Main Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ion-district
CATEGORIES:Ion District
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://iondistrict.com/wp-
 content/uploads/2026/06/HLUG_Crest-2.png?ver=1781403904
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://iondistrict.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06
 /HLUG_Crest-2.png?ver=1781403904
UID:TCukXLA-yesXQ2HnSBqSc
SUMMARY:Houston Linux User Group
DTSTAMP:20260810T100231Z
DTSTART:20260820T180000Z
DESCRIPTION:Are you interested or already invested in the Linux Operating S
	ystem? \nJoin us at the Houston Linux User Group\, one of the oldest user 
	groups involved with the Linux Operating System. We discuss new trends in 
	operating system usage\, software development\, and current technological 
	trends\, as well as provide one-on-one training or class-based instruction
	. Learn about how to get more out of your computer or how to leverage any 
	of the Linux-based computational platforms. \nAll are welcome to attend\, 
	regardless of whether you’re a seasoned Linux professional intent on netwo
	rking or a new Linux user struggling with installation or the command line
	.\nThis monthly meeting includes all of the standard Houston Linux User Gr
	oup meeting activities\, which include meet-and-greet\, presentations of p
	ersonal projects\, multi-meeting classes\, as well as organizational and c
	oordinating announcements. \nVisit our website at: https://www.houstonlinu
	x.org/\nVisit our calendar and the agenda of each week’s meeting at: https
	://calendar.google.com/calendar/u/0/embed?src=houstonlinuxusergroup@gmail.
	com \nJoin us on social media.\nDiscord: https://discord.gg/MPzYfeJz\nRedd
	it: https://www.reddit.com/r/houstonlinuxusergroup/\n\nhttps://iondistrict
	.com/event/houston-linux-user-group-8/\n\nFrom Ion District
URL:https://iondistrict.com/event/houston-linux-user-group-8/
LOCATION:Ion – Conference Room 029 – 030\, 4201 Main St\, Houston\, TX\, 77
	002\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ion-district
CATEGORIES:Ion District
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
